# Fact patterns — Pinnacle consulting fees (SOW No. 2)

Generated from `corpus/gold/fact_patterns.jsonl` (FP-051 … FP-054). FP-054 is the pattern
that corrected the gold set: the original expected date was inside the 90-day window, and
encoding § 5.3 made that visible.

> Using Consulting_fees_pinnacle as C

## FP-051 — 320 hours, invoiced on time, below the notice threshold

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestFp051:
  output computation content C.ConsultingFees

scope TestFp051:
  definition computation equals
    output of C.ConsultingFees with {
      -- hours: 320.0
      -- month_of_service: |2026-04-01|
      -- invoice_date: |2026-04-08|
    }
  assertion computation.fees = $72,000
  assertion computation.fees_payable = $72,000
  assertion computation.change_order_required = false
  assertion computation.eighty_percent_notice_required = false
  assertion computation.invoice_payable = true
```

```catala-test-cli
$ catala test-scope TestFp051
┌─[RESULT]─ TestFp051 ─
│ computation =
│   ConsultingFees {
│     -- fees: $72,000.00
│     -- fees_payable: $72,000.00
│     -- change_order_required: false
│     -- eighty_percent_notice_required: false
│     -- invoice_payable: true
│   }
└─
```

## FP-052 — 420 hours crosses the 80% notice threshold (§ 3.3)

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestFp052:
  output computation content C.ConsultingFees

scope TestFp052:
  definition computation equals
    output of C.ConsultingFees with {
      -- hours: 420.0
      -- month_of_service: |2026-06-01|
      -- invoice_date: |2026-06-09|
    }
  assertion computation.fees = $94,500
  assertion computation.eighty_percent_notice_required = true
  assertion computation.change_order_required = false
```

```catala-test-cli
$ catala test-scope TestFp052
┌─[RESULT]─ TestFp052 ─
│ computation =
│   ConsultingFees {
│     -- fees: $94,500.00
│     -- fees_payable: $94,500.00
│     -- change_order_required: false
│     -- eighty_percent_notice_required: true
│     -- invoice_payable: true
│   }
└─
```

## FP-053 — 520 hours exceeds the § 3.2 ceiling

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestFp053:
  output computation content C.ConsultingFees

scope TestFp053:
  definition computation equals
    output of C.ConsultingFees with {
      -- hours: 520.0
      -- month_of_service: |2026-07-01|
      -- invoice_date: |2026-07-08|
    }
  assertion computation.fees = $117,000
  assertion computation.fees_payable = $112,500
  assertion computation.change_order_required = true
```

```catala-test-cli
$ catala test-scope TestFp053
┌─[RESULT]─ TestFp053 ─
│ computation =
│   ConsultingFees {
│     -- fees: $117,000.00
│     -- fees_payable: $112,500.00
│     -- change_order_required: true
│     -- eighty_percent_notice_required: true
│     -- invoice_payable: true
│   }
└─
```

## FP-054 — invoiced more than 90 days after month end (§ 5.3)

April ends on 2026-04-30, so the deadline is 2026-07-29 and a 2026-08-15 invoice is out of
time.

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestFp054:
  output computation content C.ConsultingFees

scope TestFp054:
  definition computation equals
    output of C.ConsultingFees with {
      -- hours: 100.0
      -- month_of_service: |2026-04-01|
      -- invoice_date: |2026-08-15|
    }
  assertion computation.fees = $22,500
  assertion computation.invoice_payable = false
  assertion computation.fees_payable = $0
```

```catala-test-cli
$ catala test-scope TestFp054
┌─[RESULT]─ TestFp054 ─
│ computation =
│   ConsultingFees {
│     -- fees: $22,500.00
│     -- fees_payable: $0.00
│     -- change_order_required: false
│     -- eighty_percent_notice_required: false
│     -- invoice_payable: false
│   }
└─
```
